# Play test of Tiki Lagoon (CIPlay tiki_lagoon, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe - its frame is the
# generated land's middle, so the "offset" below. The main key south of the lagoon: the tiki bar (deck 2.3 m) at its shore,
# the terrace and the generator shed east of it, the manager's office on stilts (deck 4.6 m) behind them, the towel hut
# and the walkway out to the three bungalows (decks 1.1 m) over the lagoon (1.5 m deep); the deep pool (4.2 m) at the
# lagoon's east end; the north key across the lagoon, where the petting zoo's goats ran.
island Tiki Lagoon
offset 0.7206 -4.2301
expect step 0
expect title End of the Season
wait 3
# (the island's friendly animals as it arrives: hens by the bar, turtles in the lagoon, dolphins off the east shore)
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 2

# Ashore at the tiki bar (in from the terrace on its east side): the memo behind the bar, the lockbox with the net launcher
walk 16 13.8 to 14 13.8 to 12.5 13.8 h=2.3 below=4
zone bar
expect step 1
read Manager's last memo
expect step 2
open Bar lockbox
expect item NetGun 1

# The walkway out to the bungalows, the minibar
walk -11.5 7.5 to -11.5 11 to -11.5 21 to -11.5 22.2 to -6 22.2 to 6 22.2 h=1.1
open Bungalow minibar

# Across the lagoon to the north key: the two goats
at 0 36 h=1.8
catch Goat 2
expect step 3

# The deep pool: the pedal boat's box with the fuel can, the lost things barrel
at 17 27.5 h=-3.2
zone deeppool
open Pedal boat's box
expect story fuelcan 1
expect step 4
open Lost things barrel

# The generator in its shed: lights and music; up the office's ladder to the manager's safe
walk 15 17 to 21.5 16.6 to 22.3 13.2 h=2.1 below=4
use generator
expect message coughs, catches and roars
expect shown stringlights
expect story fuelcan 0
climb 22.25 3.88 h=2
expect stand 22.25 6.25 h=4.6 below=6.5
at 22.25 6.25 h=5.7
open Manager's safe
wait 2
expect done

# The towel hut's box and the staff room's chest
open Staff room chest
at -17.75 8 h=3.9
open Towel hut box
